Package: upd
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: David M. Anderson <david.anderson@excelano.com>
Depends: sudo
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/excelano/upd
Description: Update every package manager on the machine in one command
 upd runs the update for each package manager and self-updating tool it
 covers, starting with apt, and skips any that is not installed. Firmware
 updates through fwupd are off by default. A summary at the end lists
 which updates completed and which failed. ~/.config/upd/config lists the
 updates to run and is written on the first run.
